  "settings.toonBody": "How parts a skin's author made toon-style (anime hair, faces, outlines) are drawn on your screen. Deferred: lit by the game's own lights, and seen through the thermal sight. Forward: a cleaner toon look, but the thermal sight does not show those parts. Off: drawn like every other surface. Only changes what you see, not what teammates see. Applies at once and is kept for the next game.",
